# Real/demo Ambunet export data - local dev only, never commit (PII-shaped
# even in demo form: patient care records, DBS checks, incident logs, etc).
# Already caught by the blanket *.json rule above; explicit here too as
# defense-in-depth so it stays excluded even if that rule ever changes.
/ambunet-demo-export/
